### Variables (REST Client de VS Code / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Salud del servicio (healthcheck de Railway)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Catálogo de operaciones expuestas por cada proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/catalog

### Inventario - consultar stock (operación cacheable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/inventory/checkStock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "LEN-TPX1C-G12" }

### Inventario - reservar stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/inventory/reserveStock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "DEL-U2724D", "quantity": 2, "orderId": "ORD-2026-001041" }

### Inventario - reabastecer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/inventory/restockItem
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "SAM-MZV9P2T0", "quantity": 40, "supplier": "Intcomex Colombia" }

### Pedidos - crear pedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/orders/createOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUS-48213",
  "shippingCity": "Medellin",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "APL-MBP14-M4P", "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "LOG-MXM3S-GRF", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Pedidos - consultar estado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/orders/getOrderStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "ORD-2026-001041" }

### Pedidos - cancelar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/orders/cancelOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "ORD-2026-001041", "reason": "PAYMENT_TIMEOUT" }

### Pagos - procesar pago (10 % de fallo aleatorio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/payments/processPayment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "ORD-2026-001041", "amount": 14774091.00, "currency": "COP", "method": "VISA", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111" }

### Pagos - forzar caída de la pasarela (demo de alerta roja)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/payments/processPayment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "ORD-2026-001041", "amount": 459900, "method": "NEQUI", "forceFail": true }

### Pagos - estrés: multiplica la tasa de fallo base (x1..x5, máximo 60 %)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/payments/validatePaymentMethod
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "MASTERCARD", "cardNumber": "5500005555555559", "stressFactor": 5 }

### Pagos - reembolso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/payments/refundPayment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "TXN-9F2C41A07B3D", "amount": 459900.00, "reason": "DEFECTIVE_ITEM" }

### Simular carga (50 llamadas por defecto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/simulate-load

### Resumen de métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/summary

### Logs filtrados y paginados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/logs?service=PAYMENTS&status=ERROR&from=2026-10-30T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&page=0&size=20

### Reiniciar auditoría
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/logs
